{
  "name": "Stereo Flanger",
  "description": "Continuous stereo flanger with independent left/right audio paths. Rate (0.02–5 Hz, default 0.25), Delay (0.2–5 ms, default 1), Depth (0–5 ms, default 2), Feedback (-0.9–0.9, default 0.5), Stereo Phase (0–180 degrees, default 90), Mix (0–1, default 0.5). Delay sweeps from Delay to Delay + 2 * Depth; wet gain is compensated by 1 - abs(Feedback). Mix 0 is dry, 1 is wet only. Use as an insert, or set Mix to 1 for a send return. Restart the rack after changing controls.",
